  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norec, FK Norway, personnell exchange</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed exchange project aims to tackle the global challenge of microplastics pollution by leveraging the strengths of both institutions. Mu Gamma Consultants focuses on policy analysis relevant to the Global South, while NIVA brings technical expertise and policy insights from the Global North. By enhancing their capabilities in various areas, the collaboration seeks to achieve more effective outcomes in addressing microplastics pollution.</narrative>
  </description>
